/**
 * @mainpage DS Library
 *
 * @section intro Introduction
 *
 * DS Library is a modern C++17 data structure library designed
 * for learning, experimentation, and reusable software development.
 *
 * @section features Features
 *
 * Currently implemented:
 * - Vector
 *
 * Planned:
 * - Linked List
 * - Stack
 * - Queue
 * - Binary Search Tree
 * - Hash Table
 * - Graph
 *
 * @section usage Usage
 *
 * Example:
 *
 * @code
 * #include <ds/vector.hpp>
 *
 * ds::Vector<int> numbers{1, 2, 3};

 * numbers.push_back(4);
 
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section testing Testing
 *
 * The library uses Catch2 for unit testing.
 *
 * @section build Building
 *
 * The project uses CMake as its build system.
 */